<title>USA: Cone Mills completes real estate sales.</title>
<headline>Cone Mills completes real estate sales.</headline>
<dateline>GREENSBORO, N.C. 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cone Mills Corp on Wednesday said it completed the sale of some real estate assets to Long Star Opportunity Fund XLP, a Texas limited partnership.</p>
<p>Cone Mills, the world's largest producer of denim, said proceeds from the sale were about $20 million.</p>
